Privacy Policy for Movie roulette

Effective date: September 18, 2026

Movie roulette ("we", "our", or "app") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how your information is handled when you use our mobile application.
1. Information We Do Not Collect

We do not collect, store, or share any personal information, location data, or user accounts. You can use Movie roulette anonymously without registering or providing any personal details.
2. Third-Party Services (TMDB API)

Our app fetches movie data, posters, and descriptions using the TMDB (The Movie Database) API. When you browse movies, requests are sent to TMDB. Please refer to TMDB’s own terms and privacy policy regarding how they handle data.
3. Analytics and Crash Reports

The app does not use any third-party tracking or advertising SDKs. Standard anonymous crash reports or diagnostic data may be collected automatically by Apple (App Store Connect) if you have opted in to share analytics with developers on your iOS device.
4. Children’s Privacy

Our app does not knowingly collect any personal information from children under the age of 13.
5. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.
